      "name": "Matthias",
      "created_at": "2024-04-15T06:37:49.142Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I have setup a notification as with the screenshot here, which sends out an email to all users with the “Stock Manager” role. That is fine and works like a charm.</p>\n<p>However, I would like to add two specific, external, email addresses to be included in the notification. Where or how can I add these two email addresses to receive the notification? It’s ERPNext version 15.19.2.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/9/9/9965f0b3a43f183f203e7b9015c5f8599117c19b.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/9965f0b3a43f183f203e7b9015c5f8599117c19b\" title=\"Screenshot_15-4-2024_112925_erp.xgt.com.hk\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/9/9965f0b3a43f183f203e7b9015c5f8599117c19b_2_392x500.jpeg\" alt=\"Screenshot_15-4-2024_112925_erp.xgt.com.hk\" data-base62-sha1=\"lT1ss9Mh1MgqpH8RRKCv2bk09vl\" width=\"392\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/9/9965f0b3a43f183f203e7b9015c5f8599117c19b_2_392x500.jpeg, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/9/9965f0b3a43f183f203e7b9015c5f8599117c19b_2_588x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/9/9965f0b3a43f183f203e7b9015c5f8599117c19b_2_784x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FAFAF9\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot_15-4-2024_112925_erp.xgt.com.hk</span><span class=\"informations\">1250×1594 97.3 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
