      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/matthkarl\">@matthkarl</a>,</p>\n<p>Edit the row and add it.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/6/0/60380d140e58e9f66230a6b6a4c4e9878a03c581.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/60380d140e58e9f66230a6b6a4c4e9878a03c581\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/0/60380d140e58e9f66230a6b6a4c4e9878a03c581_2_690x348.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"dJbVpMVl7Zy2cPqKVRqvna1Tbgt\" width=\"690\" height=\"348\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/0/60380d140e58e9f66230a6b6a4c4e9878a03c581_2_690x348.jpeg, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/0/60380d140e58e9f66230a6b6a4c4e9878a03c581_2_1035x522.jpeg 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/0/60380d140e58e9f66230a6b6a4c4e9878a03c581_2_1380x696.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FAFAFA\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1920×969 46.9 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/6/3/63cfcc3276851faf8010b7f4753a1367500e5d1f.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/63cfcc3276851faf8010b7f4753a1367500e5d1f\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/3/63cfcc3276851faf8010b7f4753a1367500e5d1f_2_690x348.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"eeYtnXEXzsUH53EgcGumdVq906P\" width=\"690\" height=\"348\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/3/63cfcc3276851faf8010b7f475