      "id": 423672,
      "username": "kevingee",
      "name": "Aminu Tijani",
      "created_at": "2024-07-22T06:52:32.800Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Just leave the <strong>Receiver By Document field</strong> and <strong>Receiver by Role</strong> blank.</p>\n<p>Under CC, type the email address. You can input multiple email addresses by having only one email address on each line</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/7/b/7b738667d9d6f802315e8a8043c880dd8af27997.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/7b738667d9d6f802315e8a8043c880dd8af27997\" title=\"1000135243\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/b/7b738667d9d6f802315e8a8043c880dd8af27997_2_690x303.jpeg\" alt=\"1000135243\" data-base62-sha1=\"hC6eSSENu5o23tuVJZ5ZX2PGnCD\" width=\"690\" height=\"303\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/b/7b738667d9d6f802315e8a8043c880dd8af27997_2_690x303.jpeg, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/b/7b738667d9d6f802315e8a8043c880dd8af27997_2_1035x454.jpeg 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/b/7b738667d9d6f802315e8a8043c880dd8af27997_2_1380x606.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F9F8F8\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">1000135243</span><span class=\"informations\">1917×843 99.6 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
